在空数据库中（初始自动提交开启）依次执行以下 SQL，写出最后 SELECT 返回的唯一数值：____。

```sql
CREATE TABLE r(a INT,b INT);
INSERT INTO r VALUES(1,10),(1,10),(1,20),(2,20),(NULL,20);
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (SELECT DISTINCT a,b FROM r WHERE b=20) x;
```

在空数据库中（初始自动提交开启）依次执行以下 SQL，写出最后 SELECT 返回的唯一数值：____。

```sql
CREATE TABLE e(s INT,c INT,score INT,PRIMARY KEY(s,c));
INSERT INTO e VALUES(1,10,80),(1,20,NULL),(2,10,80),(2,20,90);
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT score)+COUNT(score) FROM e;
```

在空数据库中（初始自动提交开启）依次执行以下 SQL，写出最后 SELECT 返回的唯一数值：____。

```sql
CREATE TABLE d(id INT PRIMARY KEY);
CREATE TABLE e(id INT PRIMARY KEY,dept INT REFERENCES d(id),salary INT);
INSERT INTO d VALUES(1),(2),(3);
INSERT INTO e VALUES(10,1,5),(11,1,7),(12,2,4);
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (SELECT d.id FROM d LEFT JOIN e ON d.id=e.dept GROUP BY d.id HAVING COALESCE(SUM(e.salary),0)<6) x;
```

