在空数据库中（初始自动提交开启）依次执行以下 SQL，写出最后 SELECT 返回的唯一数值：____。

```sql
CREATE TABLE w(id INT PRIMARY KEY,v INT);
INSERT INTO w VALUES(1,30);
SET AUTOCOMMIT FALSE;
UPDATE w SET v=v+5 WHERE id=1;
SAVEPOINT s;
UPDATE w SET v=v*2 WHERE id=1;
ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT s;
COMMIT;
SELECT v FROM w WHERE id=1;
```

